# Golden vectors for node/search_local.situ, written by hand from its
# layout, so the description is held to a writer other than its compiler.
# 0x1A is FZN_CMD_SEARCH (26); the local leg's ops from 128 (0x80). A
# local ask is HAS_WITH and WITH, then search_wire.situ's ask byte for byte.

message list_oat      1A 80 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 03 6F 61 74 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 14 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
message fetch_with    1A 81 01 AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB 03 6F 61 74 01 05 6E 6F 74 65 73 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 14 01 00 00 00 96 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 4D 05 6C 69 6E 65 73 02 AB CD
message get           1A 82
message page          1A 83 02 01 03 02 01
message hit           1A 84 05 6E 6F 74 65 73 02 AB CD 00 00 00 64 00 00 00 00 00 00 03 E8 03 6F 61 74
message fetched       1A 85 03
